<title>USA: U.S. factory vegoil product use - Census.</title>
<headline>U.S. factory vegoil product use - Census.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. factories used 1,259.5 million lbs of vegoils in June in edible product output versus a revised 1,263.5 million lbs in May and 1,162.0 in June 1996.</p>
<p>U.S. factory vegoil use with refining losses were as follows:</p>
<p>   (Mln Lbs) --   June 97   May  97   June 96</p>
<p>    Soybean Oil   1,035.8   1,078.7-R   980.2</p>
<p> Cottonseed Oil	N/A     N/A	    N/A</p>
<p>Year-to-date oil use with refining losses (Mln Lbs):</p>
<p>				    1997	   1996</p>
<p>		 Soybean Oil   6,481.9	6,124.0</p>
<p>	    Cottonseed Oil	 N/A	    N/A</p>
<p> OUTPUT -- Soybean Crude   7,595.7	7,566.0</p>
<p>		     Refined   5,993.1	5,926.2</p>
<p>	  Cottonseed Crude     653.6	  771.2</p>
<p>		     Refined     453.3	  476.1</p>
<p>		  Corn Crude   1,108.4	  902.0</p>
<p>		     Refined     421.3	  505.0</p>
</text>
